\textbf{A. Create Job Category} \newline
1. The Admin chooses to create a job category. \newline
2. The system presents the creation form. \newline
3. The Admin enters the name (required and unique), a description (optional), and the status (active or inactive). \newline
4. The Admin confirms the creation. \newline
5. The system validates the input. \newline
6. The system creates the job category. \newline
7. The system confirms the creation to the Admin. The use case ends.
} \\ \hline

