1. The system determines that the category name already exists. \newline
2. The system displays a message indicating the name is already in use. \newline
3. Return to step 3 of the main flow. \newline
\textbf{A.3 Validation Failed} \textit{(branch at step 5)} \newline
1. The system determines that the name is missing or invalid. \newline
2. The system displays an appropriate error message. \newline
3. Return to step 3 of the main flow.
} \\ \hline

