1. The system cannot create the category due to a processing or connection error. \newline
2. The system displays the message ``Couldn't create the category. Please try again later.'' \newline
3. The admin remains on the current page without the category being created. \newline
4. The use case ends.
} \\ \hline

Priority: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{Medium} \\ \hline

